WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.960
Good morning, Hank. It's Tuesday!

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:03.120
Happy 2017!

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:06.720
Today's video is like Voldemort's soul: It comes to you in eight parts,

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:10.060
one of which is inconveniently located inside our protagonist.

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:11.400
Part One: My Snot.

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:14.400
Hank, there is so much snot inside of my body right now,

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.940
so I apologize if I sound sick. It's because I am sick.

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:21.260
Part Two: Speaking of my health, 100 Days has begun!

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.920
My best friend, Chris, and I are trying to have a healthy midlife crisis,

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:25.220
so over the next one hundred days,

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:26.860
we're gonna learn a lot about health and fitness,

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:30.460
and over at youtube.com/100days, you can see me do this,

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:31.880
and also this sweet move,

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:34.100
and also quite a lot of this.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:35.300
Mostly that, really.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.220
Doing partner abs always reminds me that

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:40.120
my stomach was made for resting a laptop upon.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:43.080
But my life is changing pretty dramatically during these one hundred days.

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:45.440
You can also follow along with us if you're so inclined,

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:48.180
and if you're at NerdCon: Nerdfighteria next month in Boston,

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:51.980
you can do a live workout with Chris and me and our trainer, Laura.

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:53.760
Part Three: Ten Year Anniversary.

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:55.120
Hank, ten years and one day ago,

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:57.600
I uploaded my first ever video to YouTube.

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:59.000
In honor of that anniversary,

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.280
here's a terrible, old school Vlogbrothers jump cut.

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:04.360
If I ever find out I only have one day to live,

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:07.860
I want it to be a day full of 2007 Vlogbrothers jump cuts.

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:09.080
Anyway, that first video began-

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:12.060
...I'm not going to be good at this.

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:13.380
I wasn't good at it, of course,

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:14.720
and in many ways, I'm still not.

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:16.440
But I feel so lucky to be at it ten years later,

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:17.380
and I just wanna say

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:20.300
thank you to everyone who's been part of the last decade with us.

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:20.900
Part Four:

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:22.700
So a while back we asked a Montana-based artist,

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:23.600
named Claire Emery

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:26.100
to make some limited edition woodblock prints

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:28.140
to celebrate vlogbrothers' tenth anniversary.

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:29.700
Claire is just an amazing artist,

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:33.380
and she created three prints to celebrate a decade of Nerdfighteria.

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:36.400
Each of them is available for pre-order now at dftba.com

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:38.240
in black and white or hand-colored.

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:39.920
We're not getting a royalty or anything on this.

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:41.120
We just love these prints

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:43.100
and wanna celebrate this anniversary.

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:43.960
So I hope you like them.

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:46.020
Also, Michael Aranda made a beautiful video about Claire

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:46.960
and her work,

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:48.300
which you can watch over at Hank's channel

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:49.320
Link in the dooblydoo.

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:49.860
Part Five:

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:51.760
Speaking of celebrating, throughout 2017,

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:53.580
Hank and I are going back to watch

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:55.280
every single Vlogbrothers video

00:01:55.280 --> 00:01:56.440
for a new project called

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:58.420
"This Date in Vlogbrothers' History"

00:01:58.420 --> 00:02:00.380
For instance, on January 3rd, 2007

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:01.860
Hank referenced for the first time

00:02:01.860 --> 00:02:03.980
that people were saying we looked like The Proclaimers.

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:05.500
And on January 3rd, 2011,

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:07.680
I made one of my most viewed videos ever,

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:09.620
which I'm sure had nothing to do with the thumbnail.

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:11.880
You can watch the videos and read our reflections on them

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:13.260
over at the Community tab

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:15.840
at youtube.com/vlogbrothers/community.

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:16.980
Or you can get notifications

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:18.440
by making sure you're subscribed—

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:20.480
there is a little button directly beneath the video—

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:22.940
and then clicking the bell to get notifications on.

00:02:22.940 --> 00:02:23.620
Part Six:

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:24.620
Hank, as you may have heard,

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:26.940
Nerdfighteria sponsors a third tier English soccer team

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:28.080
called AFC Wimbledon.

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:28.760
And this Saturday

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:30.880
at 10 a.m. Eastern time, here in the U.S.,

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:33.780
AFC Wimbledon will play in the third round of the FA Cup

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:35.020
against Sutton United,

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:38.940
a game that will be televised on proper American cable television!

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:41.060
Specifically the channel Fox Sports 1.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:43.540
Wimbledon players wear DFTBA on the back of their shorts,

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:44.860
and you can see those shorts

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:47.660
live in high definition this Saturday!

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:49.900
A group of Colorado Nerdfighters will be watching the game

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:51.880
at the Three Lions Pub in Denver,

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:53.920
and there may also be other places to watch the game

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:55.360
live with fellow Nerdfighters.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.260
I've started a Reddit thread on the topic.

00:02:57.260 --> 00:02:57.880
Link in the dooblydoo.

00:02:57.880 --> 00:02:58.500
Part Seven:

00:02:58.500 --> 00:02:59.120
Punishments.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:00.880
Hank, in your final video of 2016,

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.300
you went over four minutes

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:03.920
in a non-educational video,

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:06.040
which means, for the first time in several years,

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:08.240
we've got a vlogbrothers punishment comin'!

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:11.400
Your punishment will take place live on stage at NerdCon: Nerdfighteria.

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:12.860
I'm pretty excited about this!

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:15.260
Nerdfighters, if you have suggestions for Hank's punishment,

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:16.560
please leave them in comments.

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:17.280
Part Eight:

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:18.720
A moment of sentimentality.

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:22.960
Hank, getting to make stuff with you and Nerdfighteria over the last ten years and three days

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:25.200
has been the great professional privilege of my life.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:26.420
When we started this project,

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:28.080
we weren't particularly close.

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:30.380
Like, I left for boarding school when you were eleven,

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:32.800
so, I never really knew you as anything other than a kid.

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:34.020
I mean, before Vlogbrothers,

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:35.660
we talked on the phone maybe once a year?

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:37.360
Now it's at least twice a week.

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:38.240
These past ten years,

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:42.400
Nerdfighteria and its projects have brought so much joy and fulfillment to my life,

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:43.860
but the best of it, for me,

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:45.400
has been getting closer to you,

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:48.400
and being part of the awesome that you bring into the world.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:49.220
Thank you.

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:51.360
Hank, I'll see you on Friday.

